From dcf921dc0d460e2c46b2b8870720e622ce8d52c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:37:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] LAYOUT110 (web): at 110 % every start-up window fits a
 1920x1032 screen; no source-mapping footers / (xxx.dfm) titles
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260930 (screenshot at 110 %): "我現在需要讓放大倍率110趴時 讓圖面上所有視窗 都可以讓客戶看到 不要像圖片上有些被切半的
你可以把一些根本用不到的標示隱藏 或刪掉 像程式對應碼就根本不需要".
- page/ht9xxx.css: .srcnote (the 程式碼對應 footers) hidden in debug too; background.html winHeight() always subtracts footerH,
  dispTitle() always drops the (xxx.dfm / cpp) part of window titles.
- background.html WINDOWS: the 9 start-up windows re-laid in 1740x936 (x1.1 = 1914x1030 inside the 1920x1032 work area of the
  HMI program window), no overlap, heights = measured content: main 925x720, 機況監視列 925x140 | Contact Counter 390x346,
  Sort Count 310x272, Lot Info 390x318 | Show Message 218x225, Tester Category 245x185, BinSelect 245x526 | Control Buttons
  at x1560 (its box is 180 wide measured). #desktop 1700x1170 -> 1740x936. The old footerH of those rows removed.
- page/ht9045_opbuttons.js: the start-up line "START / PAUSE 已接到底層" (a developer note) no longer shown; the line still
  carries START / PAUSE replies and errors.
Measured headless at 110 % (offline data): all 9 boxes inside 1914x1030, 0 overlaps, no scrollbar from the layout.
Not yet seen on the machine (live Sort Count / Contact rows may differ from the offline ones; their windows scroll if longer).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 background.html          | 31 ++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 page/ht9045_opbuttons.js |  8 ++++----
 page/ht9xxx.css          |  2 ++
 3 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/background.html b/background.html
index 483b0fa..6f4c577 100644
--- a/background.html
+++ b/background.html
@@ -10,7 +10,8 @@
   body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;background:var(--desktop-bg);}
 
   #desktopWrap{flex:1;overflow:auto;}
-  #desktop{position:relative;width:1700px;height:1170px;
+  /* AI(W906-LAYOUT110) 20260930：桌面 1740×936＝110% 時放得進 1920×1032 工作區（1914×1030，不出捲軸）；開站的 9 個視窗都排在這裡面（見 WINDOWS） */
+  #desktop{position:relative;width:1740px;height:936px;
     background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--desktop-grad1),var(--desktop-grad2));}
 
   /* 視窗框 */
@@ -409,9 +410,10 @@ function reloadAllIframesWithMode(){
 }
 renderCppOfflineBadge();
